  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="43e9f900-6840-597c-b5f1-68723b3a166e" activityNameId="21b4459a-2c81-5080-8621-28b0e003e069" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cathode-ray tube, CRT screen, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cathode-ray tube, CRT screen, at plant
Data about the CRT tube production, taken from a US LCA study of CRT and LCD screens. Data represent the production of an average 17inch CRT computer screen in the late 1990s.;
UUID: a16b491e-fea2-3852-ba88-c5d089e279ba
This module includes the following production steps: production of the shadow mask, frame around the CRT, production of the cathode ray tube (i.e. coating of inner side, installation of electron gun &amp; shadow mask, fixation of funnel and panel parts, evacuation) and paletting until the complete CRT are ready for the next production step.
Location: Data from a US LCA study used as global average data
Technology: average CRT production technology in the late 1990s
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see generalComment
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a16b491e-fea2-3852-ba88-c5d089e279ba.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
